          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>$\\hat p_1=320/400=0.8$, $\\hat p_2=210/300=0.7$, so $\\hat p_1-\\hat p_2=0.1$. The standard error is $\\sqrt{\\dfrac{0.8(0.2)}{400}+\\dfrac{0.7(0.3)}{300}}=\\sqrt{0.0004+0.0007}=\\sqrt{0.0011}=0.03317$. A 90% interval uses $z_{0.05}=1.65$: $0.1\\pm1.65(0.03317)=0.1\\pm0.0547$, i.e. $(0.045,0.155)\\approx(0.05,0.15)$. (Using 1.96 would give the wider 95% interval $(0.035,0.165)$ — option A.)</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>$\\hat p_1=320/400=0{,}8$, $\\hat p_2=210/300=0{,}7$, nên $\\hat p_1-\\hat p_2=0{,}1$. Sai số chuẩn là $\\sqrt{\\dfrac{0{,}8(0{,}2)}{400}+\\dfrac{0{,}7(0{,}3)}{300}}=\\sqrt{0{,}0004+0{,}0007}=\\sqrt{0{,}0011}=0{,}03317$. Khoảng 90% dùng $z_{0{,}05}=1{,}65$: $0{,}1\\pm1{,}65(0{,}03317)=0{,}1\\pm0{,}0547$, tức $(0{,}045;0{,}155)\\approx(0{,}05;0{,}15)$. (Dùng 1,96 sẽ ra khoảng 95% rộng hơn $(0{,}035;0{,}165)$ — phương án A.)</p></div>"
