          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>By Bayes&#39; theorem with $P(\\text{paper})=P(\\text{plastic})=0.5$, $P(R\\mid\\text{paper})=2/3$ and $P(R\\mid\\text{plastic})=1/4$:<br/>$$P(\\text{paper}\\mid R)=\\frac{0.5\\times\\frac23}{0.5\\times\\frac23+0.5\\times\\frac14}=\\frac{0.3333}{0.3333+0.125}=\\frac{0.3333}{0.4583}=0.727.$$</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Dùng định lý Bayes với $P(\\text{túi giấy})=P(\\text{túi nhựa})=0{,}5$, $P(R\\mid\\text{túi giấy})=2/3$ và $P(R\\mid\\text{túi nhựa})=1/4$:<br/>$$P(\\text{túi giấy}\\mid R)=\\frac{0{,}5\\times\\frac23}{0{,}5\\times\\frac23+0{,}5\\times\\frac14}=\\frac{0{,}3333}{0{,}3333+0{,}125}=\\frac{0{,}3333}{0{,}4583}=0{,}727.$$</p></div>"
